From: Sid Jain <sid_26@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] postmaster: supply the engine build closure

Keep CLI/workspace dependency integration for the sealed carrier. The product
compiler/executor, memory profile and startup proof are now first-party sources
in src/wasix/postmaster/executor, not patched into Wasmer. This patch retains
the main branch engine build closure; Cargo locks and features remain pinned.

Extracted without runtime hunk changes from the inherited integration bundle.
The complete ordered series is the build and qualification unit.

